# ============================================================
#  Places (design §6.1). Positions are on the campus map
#  (960 × 680, see docs/map-concept.svg): the castle stands on the
#  north shore of the Mirror Lake, the village to the south-east,
#  the Whisperwood to the west. Data only until phase 2b.
#
#  open:      the slots a place can be visited in
#  discover:  when it becomes visible (omit for places open from the start)
#  hint:      teaser shown while hinted (hinted_when) but not yet discovered
#  draws:     tags of older events (no place: yet) that may happen here (compat, phase 2b)
# ============================================================

# ---------------- Public from the start ----------------

@place courtyard
name: The Courtyard
region: castle
map: campus 585,278
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening night
art: tower
draws: social festival rival story
desc: Flagstones worn smooth by three centuries of students, a fountain that freezes when it shouldn't, and the best gossip in the castle.

@place library
name: The Library
region: castle
map: campus 380,275
kind: public
track: library_assistant
open: morning noon afternoon evening night
art: book
draws: study
# The revision card comes first on a term visit, once a term (2026-10-19).
always: library_revision
desc: Seven floors of shelves that rearrange themselves when nobody is looking. Footnote the cat keeps order.

@place refectory
name: The Refectory
region: castle
map: campus 470,278
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening midnight
art: meal
draws: social home money
desc: Long tables, longer benches, and soup that tastes faintly of whatever you're homesick for.

@place lakeshore
name: The Lakeshore
region: grounds
map: campus 480,505
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening night midnight
art: wave
draws: nature mystery romance
desc: The Mirror Lake lies so still it shows the towers upside down. On some nights it shows other things.

@place village
name: The Village Square
region: village
map: campus 720,520
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening
art: house
draws: money home
# The shop counter (world expansion 1, K3): what it sells, first on every visit.
always: shop_square
desc: A barge ride across the lake: crooked roofs, a market square, a bakery that has fed students for two hundred years and shopkeepers who have seen every kind of student.

# ---------------- Castle ----------------

@place lecture_tower
name: The Lecture Tower
region: castle
map: campus 420,180
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening
art: scroll
draws: class study exam
desc: Spiral lecture halls stacked one above another. Evocation on the lower floors, where scorch marks are expected; Umbral Theory at the top, where the lamps burn dim.

@place observatory
name: The Observatory
region: castle
map: campus 600,175
kind: public
open: afternoon evening night midnight
art: planet
draws: magic mystery
desc: A brass dome at the top of the east tower. The great telescope points wherever it likes; usually that is the right place.

@place great_hall
name: The Great Hall
region: castle
map: campus 455,215
kind: public
open: noon afternoon evening
art: crown
draws: festival social
desc: Floating candles, a vaulted ceiling that shows tomorrow's weather, and the stage where the choir rehearses and the Midwinter Ball is held.

@place infirmary
name: The Infirmary
region: castle
map: campus 530,200
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening night midnight
art: potion
draws: crisis danger
desc: Clean white beds, a cupboard of tonics and Sister Amaranth, who has seen every kind of injury and believes none of the excuses.

@place alchemy_lab
name: The Alchemy Laboratory
region: castle
map: campus 555,240
kind: public
open: morning afternoon evening
art: cauldron
draws: class magic
desc: Long benches, cauldrons in every size, and a ventilation charm that has given up on the third floor.

@place workshop
name: Mir's Workshop
region: castle
map: campus 615,235
kind: public
open: afternoon evening night
closed_when: flag(mir_workshop_shut) and since(mir_workshop_closed) < 3
discover: met(mir)
hint: Something clanks and hums behind the west-wing tapestry.
hinted_when: turn >= 2
art: gear
draws: magic
desc: A former classroom full of springs, gears, half-finished machines and the smell of solder. Fire buckets by the door, on the faculty's orders.

@place job_board
name: The Job Board
region: castle
map: campus 520,262
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening
art: paper
draws: job money
# The job menu first on every visit, then one odd gig (feedback 2026-10-15).
always: job_board_visit
desc: A cork board in the entrance hall layered with notices: jobs, lost familiars, club recruitment and the occasional ransom note for a sock.

@place ledger_office
name: The Lumen Ledger Office
region: castle
map: campus 395,230
kind: club
track: lumen_ledger
open: afternoon evening night
discover: member(lumen_ledger) or met(nessa)
art: paper
draws: club
desc: A cramped room under the library stairs, walls papered with old front pages. The printing press groans like a dragon on deadline night.

@place headmistress_tower
name: The Headmistress's Tower
region: castle
map: campus 500,130
kind: public
open: afternoon evening
discover: rel(isolde) >= 12 or flag(warden_trial)
hint: A spiral stair guarded by a stone owl that only opens its eyes for some students.
hinted_when: met(isolde)
art: crown
draws: story
desc: Books, tea and a board of crystal towers by the window. You are only here because she wants you here.

@place restricted_section
name: The Restricted Section
region: castle
map: campus 352,245
kind: public
open: afternoon evening midnight
discover: flag(forbidden_key) or seen(forbidden_section_1) > 0 or flag(heist_stacks_known)
hint: A door at the back of the library that is always locked, and always slightly warm.
hinted_when: turn >= 2
art: lock
draws: mystery danger
desc: Black-bound books that breathe in the dark. Some of them read you back.

@place gargoyle_passage
name: The Third Gargoyle
region: castle
map: campus 418,135
kind: society
track: cartographers
open: afternoon evening midnight
discover: member(cartographers)
hint: Corvin keeps glancing at a particular gargoyle.
hinted_when: met(corvin)
art: map
draws: club mystery
desc: Behind the third gargoyle on the north parapet, a passage that isn't on any map. Except theirs.

@place seventh_tower
name: The Seventh Tower
region: castle
map: campus 500,72
kind: public
open: afternoon evening
discover: clue(lead_seventh_tower) or clues(hollowstar) >= 4 or flag(heist_tower_known)
hint: A locked stair that leads up into a tower nobody admits is there.
hinted_when: clock(hollowstar) >= 1
art: key
draws: mystery story
desc: Locked for a century. At the very top, one room of dust and moonlight, and a star-shaped hollow in the wall.

@place thesis_lab
name: The Thesis Laboratory
region: castle
map: campus 565,160
kind: thesis
track: thesis
open: morning afternoon evening
discover: year >= 4
art: book
draws: study
desc: Rows of carrels where final-year students and their advisors argue about footnotes until the candles give out.

# ---------------- Grounds ----------------

@place duel_hall
name: The Duelling Hall
region: grounds
map: campus 660,150
kind: club
track: duelling
open: afternoon evening
discover: member(duelling) or rel(lyra) >= 9
hint: Steel rings somewhere above the east stair.
hinted_when: met(lyra)
art: duel
draws: rival
desc: Scorched floorboards and a ceiling that has seen things. The practice dummies have names, and grudges.

@place greenhouses
name: The Greenhouses
region: grounds
map: campus 740,235
kind: club
track: verdant
open: morning afternoon evening
discover: member(verdant) or met(tobias) or met(maud)
art: leaf
draws: nature
desc: Glass houses that steam even in winter. The moonflowers bloom once every eleven years; the mandrakes have opinions every day.

@place flight_field
name: The Flight Field
region: grounds
map: campus 850,300
kind: public
open: morning afternoon evening
art: broom
draws: club
desc: A long green field with hoops at either end and a wind that cheats. Broom lessons, races and spectacular landings.

@place stables
name: The Familiar Stables
region: grounds
map: campus 845,385
kind: public
open: morning afternoon evening
art: paw
draws: nature
desc: Hippogriffs, a sulky griffon chick, owls in the rafters and Professor Brask, who talks to all of them more kindly than to students.

@place boathouse
name: The Boathouse
region: grounds
map: campus 610,440
kind: public
open: afternoon evening night midnight
art: wave
draws: social mystery romance
# A boathouse night (feedback 2026-10-16): the ring first (either door), then one drawn card.
always: midnight_boathouse_ring|ring_on_yourself
desc: An old wooden boathouse and a jetty out over the water. People come here to say the things they can't say indoors.

@place orchard
deprecated: maud_cottage
name: The Orchard
region: grounds
map: campus 790,165
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening
art: tree
draws: nature romance
desc: Apple and pear trees older than the towers. In spring the blossom falls like snow; once, it was snow.

@place maud_cottage
name: Old Maud's Cottage
region: grounds
map: campus 780,400
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening
discover: met(maud)
art: house
draws: nature home romance
desc: A thatched cottage with chickens on the doorstep, bees in the eaves, a goat called Bartholomew and a kettle that is always nearly boiling. Behind it, apple and pear trees older than the towers.

@place secret_garden
name: The Secret Garden
region: grounds
map: campus 815,425
kind: public
open: morning afternoon evening
discover: seen(garden_maud_secret) > 0
hint: A door in the wall behind the potting shed that you keep walking past.
hinted_when: met(maud)
art: flower
draws: nature magic
desc: Glowing ferns, silver bees and a pear tree that hums. It only exists for people Maud has shown it to.

@place courier_loft
name: The Courier Loft
region: grounds
map: campus 880,230
kind: job
track: broom_courier
open: morning afternoon evening
discover: turn >= 3
art: letter
draws: job
desc: A draughty loft full of parcels, pigeonholes and brooms in various states of repair. The dispatch bell rings at all hours.

# ---------------- Village ----------------

@place gilded_newt
name: The Gilded Newt
region: village
map: campus 800,480
kind: job
track: tavern
open: afternoon evening night midnight
art: cup
draws: job money social
# A Newt night (feedback 2026-10-16): the company offer first, then the high table.
always: newt_company newt_company_regular newt_high_table shop_newt
desc: The village tavern: low beams, a fire that never goes out, and a landlady who remembers every student's tab to the penny.

@place mabels
name: Mabel's Tea Shop
region: village
map: campus 725,565
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon evening
art: cup
draws: social home
# The shop counter (world expansion 1, K3): what it sells, first on every visit.
always: shop_mabels
desc: Forty kinds of tea, three kinds of cake and Mabel, who reads your mood from the way you open the door.

@place grimsbys_books
name: Grimsby's Books
region: village
map: campus 680,600
kind: public
open: noon afternoon evening
art: book
draws: study money
# The shop counter (world expansion 1, K3): what it sells, first on every visit.
always: shop_grimsbys
desc: A bookshop so crowded the shelves lean on each other for support. Mr Grimsby will find anything except what you came in for.

@place pell_apothecary
name: Pell & Daughters
region: village
map: campus 770,600
kind: job
track: apothecary_clerk
open: morning afternoon evening
art: bottle
draws: job money
# The shop counter (world expansion 1, K3): what it sells, first on every visit.
always: shop_pell
desc: An apothecary of a thousand labelled drawers. Old Pell taught three generations to count drops; his daughters taught him to smile at customers.

@place bakery
deprecated: village
name: The Bakery
region: village
map: campus 640,555
kind: public
open: morning noon afternoon
art: meal
draws: home money
desc: The same family has baked here for two hundred years. The buns are famous; so, in certain circles, is a letter that arrived very late.

# ---------------- Wilds ----------------

@place whisperwood
name: The Whisperwood
region: wilds
map: campus 185,340
kind: public
open: morning afternoon evening night midnight
discover: met(maud) or flag(fox_met)
hint: Fog sits on the western woods even at noon.
hinted_when: turn >= 2
art: tree
draws: nature danger mystery
always: ww_edge ww_edge_night|ww_night_first
desc: An old forest that talks in its sleep. Moonpetal grows in its clearings; so do things that are better left there.

# ---------------- Internship hosts (one map each; design §7.5) ----------------

@place royal_library_archives
name: The Royal Library Archives
region: internship:royal_library
map: royal_library 480,300
kind: internship
track: intern_royal_library
open: morning afternoon
art: book
desc: Miles of stacks beneath the capital, where the oldest records of the realm are kept in temperature-controlled silence.

@place conclave_laboratory
name: The Conclave Laboratory
region: internship:conclave
map: conclave 480,300
kind: internship
track: intern_conclave
open: morning afternoon evening
art: wand
desc: The research laboratory of the Conclave of the Seven Towers, where new spells are tested behind very thick walls.

@place alchemists_works
name: The Guild Works
region: internship:alchemists
map: alchemists 480,300
kind: internship
track: intern_alchemists
open: morning afternoon
art: cauldron
desc: The Guild of Alchemists' great works by the river: vats, chimneys and a strict rule about naked flames.

@place observatory_camp
name: The Expedition Camp
region: internship:expedition
map: expedition 480,300
kind: internship
track: intern_expedition
open: afternoon evening night
art: planet
desc: Tents on a high plateau where the air is thin and the stars are close enough to argue with.

@place field_station
name: The Beastcraft Field Station
region: internship:field_station
map: field_station 480,300
kind: internship
track: intern_field_station
open: morning afternoon evening
art: paw
desc: A cabin on the moors, ringed with paddocks and nesting towers, where injured creatures are mended and wild ones are counted.

@place thornwick_lab
name: The Thornwick Exchange Lab
region: internship:thornwick
map: thornwick 480,300
kind: internship
track: intern_thornwick
open: morning afternoon evening
art: mask
desc: A guest laboratory at Thornwick Academy, the rival school, where the illusionists are excellent and the hospitality is suspicious.

@place unseen_office
name: The Office of Unseen Affairs
region: internship:unseen_office
map: unseen_office 480,300
kind: internship
track: intern_unseen_office
open: evening night
art: eye
desc: The Crown's Office of Unseen Affairs. It has no sign, no address, and a very good coffee machine.

# ---------------- Home (the "go home" break plan; map: home) ----------------

@place home_cottage
name: The Family Cottage
region: home
map: home 485,320
kind: plan
open: morning noon afternoon evening night
art: house
draws: home
desc: The kitchen table, the creaky stair, the smell of whatever is in the oven. Everyone asks how school is.

@place home_fields
name: The Fields
region: home
map: home 310,320
kind: plan
open: morning afternoon evening
art: leaf
draws: nature home
desc: Long rows, a low wall to sit on, and the same view you used to stare at when you dreamed of towers.

@place home_market
name: The Market Town
region: home
map: home 770,240
kind: plan
open: noon afternoon evening
art: coin
draws: money social
desc: Market stalls, the old crowd outside the inn, and the one shop that still sells your favourite sweets.
